/*
 mq-dir Localizable.strings (en)

 Keys are dot-namespaced:
   - mqdir.app.*         :  app-level globals
   - mqdir.menu.*        :  macOS menu bar items (File / Edit / View / Window)
   - mqdir.settings.*    :  Settings window (Appearance / Language / Shortcuts / Filenames)
   - mqdir.shortcut.*    :  ShortcutAction human-readable labels
   - mqdir.sidebar.*     :  Sidebar UI (Projects / Favorites / Tags / cmux)
   - mqdir.browser.*     :  Browser pane (toolbar / tabs / context menu / empty state)
   - mqdir.preview.*     :  Preview panel & zip-preview strings
   - mqdir.feedback.*    :  Feedback sheet
   - mqdir.main.*        :  Main window toolbar / status bar / search box
   - mqdir.colorScheme.* :  Appearance picker labels
   - mqdir.language.*    :  Language picker labels
   - mqdir.common.*      :  Shared verbs (Cancel / Save / Clear / Search …)
   - mqdir.project.*     :  Project CRUD helpers (nextProjectName, etc.)
*/

